{
  "buildScript": 1,
  "title": "Cathedral",
  "description": "Brief: a Gothic cathedral on a square. Twin west towers with 75-degree spires and pinnacles, a portal with a porch and a rose window of stained glass, a tall nave with a clerestory over lower aisles under lean-to roofs, buttresses between pointed lancet windows, a transept with triple lancets, a crossing tower with a spire and a choir with an altar. Inside: an arcade of arches between nave and aisles, a tiled floor, pews, and a west gallery with an organ up a flight of stairs. Outside: a paved square with lamps and benches, lawns with trees and flowers, a railing round the grounds.",
